xssniper (1.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * New upstream release: xssniper v1.0 "ATHEX!".
  * 1487 XSS vectors; modern WAF bypassers (Cloudflare, Akamai, AWS, Azure,
    Wordfence, FortiWeb, ...) and character-encoding bypassers.
  * Dorking engine rewritten with 7 providers; PDF and JSON reporting.
  * --reverse-check headless-browser confirmation (no false positives).
  * Removed Twitter and Flash support; ported to Selenium 4.

